            "\n",
            "In Section~\\ref{sec:claim-split}, we evaluated the subclaims obtained using \\claimsplit{} for completeness and correctness criteria. Figure~\\ref{fig:claimsplit_verification_instructions} shows the instructions provided to the crowd annotators for this task. It includes three examples, one correct split of claims into subclaims, one example where the subclaims fail the completeness criterion and one where they fail the correctness criterion. \n",
